note bottom of RestaurantRushCLI
  PLAYABLE Stage 1 entry point:
  java -cp out game.RestaurantRushCLI
  Waiter decision precedes Chef decision.
end note

note bottom of LegacyCLI
  Original Person 5 placeholder.
  Methods remain unimplemented.
end note

note bottom of Customer
  setStatus() is PUBLIC in current code,
  used by TurnProcessor for abandonment.
  This differs from the stated design intent.
end note

note bottom of GameState
  Exactly 18 turns, two tables.
  Victory: paid >= 4, revenue >= 4500 cents,
  average paid satisfaction >= 60.
  Collection getters return unmodifiable views.
end note

note bottom of TurnProcessor
  End-turn order:
  eating -> payment -> satisfaction -> abandonment.
  Maximum one payment per turn.
end note

